{
 "language": "en",
 "segments": [
  {
   "start": 0.36,
   "end": 6.94,
   "text": "Hey everybody forget the burgers forget the fries tonight we're making Persian chicken"
  },
  {
   "start": 6.94,
   "end": 17.06,
   "text": "paradise get your saffron grab your skewers let's make some jujee kebab two pounds of"
  },
  {
   "start": 17.06,
   "end": 28.86,
   "text": "chicken cut into squares boneless thighs or breasts nobody cares to onion slice let the flavor flow"
  },
  {
   "start": 29.86,
   "end": 38.4,
   "text": "add some yogurt if you like it slow fresh lemon juice a little lime olive oil to make it"
  },
  {
   "start": 38.4,
   "end": 45.04,
   "text": "shine salt and pepper just a pinch turmeric too for a golden finish but wait a minute"
  },
  {
   "start": 45.04,
   "end": 48.38,
   "text": "Here's the key, saffron, water, strong and free"
  },
  {
   "start": 48.38,
   "end": 50.66,
   "text": "Crush those threads at water hot"
  },
  {
   "start": 50.66,
   "end": 53.14,
   "text": "That's the magic, that's the spy"
  },
  {
   "start": 53.14,
   "end": 57.06,
   "text": "Juje, juje, golden chicken come my way"
  },
  {
   "start": 57.06,
   "end": 62.02,
   "text": "Saffron shining lemon bright, Persian chicken done just right"
  },
  {
   "start": 62.02,
   "end": 65.98,
   "text": "Juje, juje, let it marinate way"
  },
  {
   "start": 65.98,
   "end": 68.28,
   "text": "On the fire, smell that heat"
  },
  {
   "start": 68.28,
   "end": 70.46,
   "text": "Nothing beats this juicytree"
  },
  {
   "start": 71.2,
   "end": 73.34,
   "text": "Mix it up and coat each piece"
  },
  {
   "start": 73.34,
   "end": 77.86,
   "text": "Let the flavors have their peace, cover tight and chill all night"
  },
  {
   "start": 77.86,
   "end": 82.4,
   "text": "For hours minimum works just right, don't rush the chicken, let it rest"
  },
  {
   "start": 82.4,
   "end": 86.9,
   "text": "That's how you make the very best before the grill, shake off the sauce"
  },
  {
   "start": 86.9,
   "end": 89.42,
   "text": "Too much marinade can cause a loss"
  },
  {
   "start": 89.42,
   "end": 93.78,
   "text": "Take your skewers, slide them through, leave a little space between each cube"
  },
  {
   "start": 93.78,
   "end": 98.3,
   "text": "Keep the pieces even in size, that's how you get that perfect prize"
  },
  {
   "start": 98.3,
   "end": 102.72,
   "text": "Chocolate blowing flames are low Place the chicken, let it go"
  },
  {
   "start": 102.72,
   "end": 107.34,
   "text": "Turn it off then nice and slow Golden edges, start to show"
  },
  {
   "start": 107.34,
   "end": 111.66,
   "text": "Brush with butter, saffron, too Lemon butter, coming through"
  },
  {
   "start": 111.66,
   "end": 116.48,
   "text": "Cook it fully, don't guess the time 74 degrees, that's the line"
  },
  {
   "start": 116.48,
   "end": 120.98,
   "text": "Grilled tomato, side by side Fresh green herbs and onions fried"
  },
  {
   "start": 120.98,
   "end": 125.26,
   "text": "Saffron rice, a little butter Persian flavors, nothing better"
  },
  {
   "start": 125.26,
   "end": 128.6,
   "text": "Sumac, sprinkled lemon, squeezed, eat it hot"
  },
  {
   "start": 128.6,
   "end": 132.24,
   "text": "Enjoy the feast from Persian kitchens to the world"
  },
  {
   "start": 132.24,
   "end": 134.68,
   "text": "Juja kebab, the golden bird"
  },
  {
   "start": 136.84,
   "end": 140.52,
   "text": "Juja, juja, golden chicken, hip hooray"
  },
  {
   "start": 140.52,
   "end": 142.76,
   "text": "Saffron, lemon, charcoal, heat"
  },
  {
   "start": 142.76,
   "end": 145.06,
   "text": "Persian cooking, can't be beat"
  },
  {
   "start": 145.76,
   "end": 149.64,
   "text": "Juja, juja, bring your friends and come this way"
  },
  {
   "start": 149.64,
   "end": 151.86,
   "text": "Rice and butter, herbs so green"
  },
  {
   "start": 151.86,
   "end": 159.66,
   "text": "best chicken you've ever seen and remember my friends saffron is gold"
  },
  {
   "start": 159.66,
   "end": 164.72,
   "text": "patience is key and never serve raw chicken at your barbecue"
  }
 ],
